## Alloys

<Box>
  <GuideReagentEmbed Reagent="BronzeMolten"/>
</Box>
**Bronze**
Color: [color=#B36215]Bronze (#B36215)[/color]

**Crafting recipe (mixing proportions):**
To obtain bronze, you need to heat the furnace to at least **900 degrees** and mix:
- 1 part molten copper (`CopperMolten`)
- 1 part molten tin (`TinMolten`)
As a result of the reaction, you will get 2 parts of molten bronze (`BronzeMolten`).

